  "title": "Pipeline badge stays red after a retry",
  "description": "After retrying a failed job from the CI/CD step, the badge on the workflow rail keeps its red dot until the app is restarted.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Open a project whose last pipeline failed\n2. Retry the failed job\n3. Wait for it to succeed\n\n## Expected\n\nThe dot disappears once the pipeline is green.",
